<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins $2.00-5.00 higher; butts steady to 2.00 higher; skinned hams steady in a narrow test; seedless bellies 2.00-3.00 lower; lean trimmings mostly steady to 1.00 higher.</p>
<p>Trading slow to moderate, with moderate retail demand and light processing demand, with overall light offerings. -USDA</p>
